<title>JAPAN: Japan Mar service price index off 0.4 pct y/y--BOJ.</title>
<headline>Japan Mar service price index off 0.4 pct y/y--BOJ.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's corporate service price index (CSPI) fell 0.4 percent in March from a year earlier, but was up 0.2 percent from the previous month, the Bank of Japan (BOJ) said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The overall index stood at 101.9 for March. The index tracks price movements in the service industry and uses 1990 as its base year.</p>
<p>The following are percentage changes in components of the index year-on-year (Y-Y) and month-on-month (M-M):</p>
<p>			   MAR Y-Y M-M	 FEB  Y-Y   M-M</p>
<p> Finance/Insurance	0.0  0.0	     0.0 +0.1</p>
<p> Real estate	     -0.9 +0.1	    -1.2 -0.2</p>
<p> Transport		 +0.2 +0.4	    +0.3 +0.7</p>
<p> Information services  -0.1  0.0	    -0.1  0.0</p>
<p> Communications	  -1.4  0.0	    -2.3 -1.1</p>
<p> Advertising services  +1.6 +1.9	    +1.6 +1.1</p>
<p> Lease/rental services -4.6 -0.1	    -5.1 -0.1</p>
<p> Other services	  +0.4  0.0	    +0.5 -0.1</p>
</text>
